  m_text: '<b>HOW TO PLAY MALAJONG:</b>


    Pair: 2 matching tiles. Chow: 3 consecutive
    ranks in one suit.

    Pong: 3 matching tiles. Kong: 4 matching tiles.

    You
    have 4 plays and 3 discards per round. Discard up to 5 tiles at once.

    Beat
    the target, buy spirits, and clear all 5 rounds. BEST PLAY suggests your highest
    score.'
